       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the labeled maximum for adults, which is 3,200 mg/day under prescriber supervision. Doses that high greatly raise the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nHere are some options within the limit:\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily.** This is 3,200 mg/day, the maximum.\n- **600 mg by mouth, 4 times daily.** This is 2,400 mg/day.\n- **400 mg by mouth, every 6 hours.** This is 1,600 mg/day, a common starting dose for pain.\n\nMaybe you meant 1600 mg as the total daily dose, or 400 mg four times daily. Tell me which dose you want and I'll enter it right away."
